Oddiy joylashtirish tartiblashi — O(n²): massiv boʻylab yurish, toʻgʻri joyda boʻlmagan
element topilguncha; uni toʻgʻri pozitsiyaga joylashtirish; massiv oxirigacha takror-
lash. Ikkita funksiyaga boʻlingan:
/* move previous elements down until insertion point reached */
void shift_element(unsigned int i) {
int ivalue;
/* guard against going outside array */
for (ivalue = arr[i]; i && arr[i-1] > ivalue; i--)
arr[i] = arr[i-1]; /* move element down */
arr[i] = ivalue;
/* insert element */
}
/* iterate until out-of-order element found;
shift the element, and continue iterating */
void insertion_sort(void) {
unsigned int i, len = array_length(arr);
for (i = 1; i < len; i++)
if (arr[i] < arr[i-1])
shift_element(i);
}
Tezkor tartiblash usullari (shellsort, mergesort, quicksort. . .): quicksort — oʻrtacha
holatda O(n log n), yomon holatda O(n²); asosiy elementni (pivot) tanlash; kichikroq
elementlarni bir tomonga, kattalarini ikkinchi tomonga koʻchirish; tomonlarni alo-
hida tartiblash (rekursiv algoritm); standart kutubxonada stdlib.h da qsort() sifatida
amalga oshirilgan. K&R dan amalga oshirish:
void quick_sort(unsigned int left, unsigned int right) {
unsigned int i, mid;
int pivot;
if (left >= right)
return; /* nothing to sort */
/* pivot is midpoint; move to left side */
swap(arr + left, arr + (left + right) / 2);
pivot = arr[mid = left];
/* separate into side < pivot (left+1 to mid)
and side >= pivot (mid+1 to right) */
for (i = left + 1; i <= right; i++)
if (arr[i] < pivot)
swap(arr + ++mid, arr + i);
/* restore pivot position */
swap(arr + left, arr + mid);
